037/h0059240"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 (2026). 市场监管总局公布一批传统工艺市场「打假清源」典型案例. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_1529399cfe874b8780c4496eb0158020.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_1529399cfe874b8780c4496eb0158020.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["结论只有一个：它的功效无从核查，也测不出任何预测能力。不评价任何信仰或者习俗，也不针对送礼、纪念、传家这些用途。要分清两件事。商家宣称的功效有明文规定可依，能去投诉。而「转运」这类说法既没有研究，也没法证明它是假的，只能靠自己划预算管住。买之前先把它当成普通饰品，问自己一句「如果它什么都不改变，这个价钱我还买吗」。材质和证书怎么查、把它当投资为什么不划算，见第 5 节第 33、34 条（手串名表按花掉的钱算、珠宝玉石认 CMA 报告）。花钱算命见本节第 15 条（算命塔罗星座）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/06-21"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"不要为了防肾结石把钙戒掉"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"不要指望买东西改善心情或身份感"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要靠通用体检套餐防病，按年龄性别做那几项有证据的筛查"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["定期做通用健康检查的人，和不做的人死亡率一样，死于心血管病、癌症的也一样多。按年龄性别做那几项有证据的筛查就够了。35 岁以上每年能免费量一次血压，65 岁以上…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要因为体检查出尿酸高、但从没痛过，就开始吃降尿酸药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["尿酸超标、但从没发作过痛风也没长痛风石的人，美国风湿病学会建议先不吃降尿酸药。24 个人吃满 3 年，才拦得住一次痛风发作。想靠它护肾也落空了，肾病病人吃药，肾…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要因为体检查出胆囊结石、但从没疼过，就去预防性切胆囊"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["胆囊里有石头、但从没疼过的人，近九年里约八成一直没出症状。不动它，每年出胆囊炎、胰腺炎这类急症的约千分之一到千分之三。切胆囊也不是零风险，约 1.5% 的人胆管…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要为了「在周围人里往上挪一档」多花钱换房、换车、换圈子"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["拿收入一样的人来比，邻居挣得越多，这个人报告的幸福感越低。这主要发生在学历和自己相同的邻居身上，常和邻居来往的人更明显。所以为了搬进一个人人都比你宽裕的地方而多…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要相信「意志力像肌肉，用一会儿就没了」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["流行的说法是：先做一件费自控的事，接下来就更容易破功，所以要省着用意志力。23 个实验室、2141 人按同一套方案重做了这个实验，结果几乎是零。别再用「今天意志…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要指望吃早餐或 16:8 轻断食帮你控制体重，吃饭时间挑你能长期坚持的"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["流行说法是不吃早餐会让人午饭晚饭暴食，一天总量反而更多。试验里不是这样：不吃早餐的人一天少吃了两百多千卡，体重还略轻一点。16:8 和单纯少吃比，一年下来体重也…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/06"},"children":["阅读整个主题：反面清单 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 